WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 1

01:43.680 --> 01:45.950
=Zhang Qing, a university student=

01:50.160 --> 01:52.670
=Professor Ye, a university professor=

01:53.330 --> 01:54.370
I've told you many times that

01:54.370 --> 01:55.710
I will never tutor any students.

01:55.730 --> 01:57.130
Please have a look at it first.

01:57.220 --> 01:58.690
About the thesis you emailed me,

01:58.690 --> 01:59.990
I've already read it

02:00.010 --> 02:01.240
and replied it as well.

02:01.260 --> 02:02.920
I've made it clearly that

02:02.940 --> 02:04.070
I don't agree with you about

02:04.090 --> 02:05.690
analyzing History of Ancient Literature

02:05.690 --> 02:06.990
with modern ideas.

02:07.010 --> 02:08.760
So don't waste your time any more.

02:08.780 --> 02:10.370
This is not a thesis.

02:10.570 --> 02:11.820
It's an online contest

02:11.820 --> 02:12.730
about science fiction held by Tencent.

02:12.730 --> 02:13.880
This is the schedule.

02:13.900 --> 02:15.400
Contestants should deliver
their manuscripts every week.

02:16.090 --> 02:17.450
Every week,

02:17.620 --> 02:18.990
they will eliminate some of them.

02:19.010 --> 02:21.170
And the last one left will be the champion.

02:21.650 --> 02:22.620
Why do you tell me this?

02:22.620 --> 02:23.920
It makes no sense.

02:24.090 --> 02:25.140
You object the collision between modern ideas

02:25.140 --> 02:26.600
and ancient literature

02:26.620 --> 02:27.490
because it's a topic

02:27.490 --> 02:29.040
that can't be testified.

02:29.060 --> 02:30.890
But what if I use another way?

02:34.650 --> 02:36.370
I have registered for the contest.

02:36.900 --> 02:38.250
It's a theme about science fiction.

02:39.420 --> 02:40.980
The story is the collision of modern ideas

02:40.980 --> 02:42.920
and ancient systems.

02:43.010 --> 02:44.070
The topic is

02:44.090 --> 02:46.250
“If You Have a Chance to Live Once Again”.

02:51.820 --> 02:53.010
Why do you choose the topic

02:53.010 --> 02:55.470
about another chance to live?

02:55.490 --> 02:57.120
In everyone's mind,

02:57.180 --> 02:58.180
more or less,

02:58.180 --> 03:00.000
all of us may think about to live once again

03:00.090 --> 03:00.900
because we have too many regrets

03:00.900 --> 03:02.330
in our whole life.

03:03.180 --> 03:05.330
So the real significance of this story is that

03:05.420 --> 03:07.120
we should cherish the present life

03:07.140 --> 03:08.730
and live for happiness.

03:24.620 --> 03:26.630
You can't even write the first word out?

03:26.650 --> 03:28.250
Of course not.

03:28.570 --> 03:30.400
I have finished the first chapters.

03:30.420 --> 03:34.120
But now I just need a name.

03:36.180 --> 03:37.490
The second version of "A Dream of Red Mansions"

03:37.490 --> 03:39.330
published by the Humanities Club in 1957.

03:40.900 --> 03:42.730
“Leave behind a residue of joy! ”

03:43.260 --> 03:45.760
Fortunate enough your mother, your own mother,

03:45.780 --> 03:47.480
will have laid by a store of virtue and
secret meritorious actions!

03:47.850 --> 03:50.630
My advice to you, mankind, is to relieve
the destitute and succour the distressed!

03:50.650 --> 03:52.270
Do not resemble those

03:52.290 --> 03:54.210
who will harp after lucre and show themselves
unmindful of the ties of relationship:

03:54.210 --> 03:56.040
that wolflike maternal uncle of yours
and that impostor of a brother!

03:56.060 --> 03:57.450
“Leave behind a residue of joy! ” from the twelve songs

03:57.450 --> 03:59.120
in The Dream of the Red Chamber.

04:00.850 --> 04:02.370
What a coincidence!

04:03.490 --> 04:04.880
This song

04:04.900 --> 04:07.250
matches my story well.

04:07.420 --> 04:08.600
Excuse me?

04:08.620 --> 04:09.980
Could you please connect my computer

04:09.980 --> 04:11.730
with that screen?

04:11.930 --> 04:13.250
Okay.

04:24.400 --> 04:27.870
Joy of Life

04:29.890 --> 04:32.290
The story starts from here.

04:49.260 --> 04:52.150
There's a young man in the modern times
who suffers from myasthenia gravis.

04:52.170 --> 04:53.850
When he wakes up,

04:54.050 --> 04:56.090
he finds that he becomes a baby in a bamboo basket

04:57.460 --> 04:58.420
but he still keeps all memories

04:58.420 --> 05:00.690
about the modern society.

05:01.020 --> 05:03.760
Now he is surrounded and
attacked by killers in ancient costumes.

05:06.050 --> 05:07.520
When he is still in doubt,

05:07.540 --> 05:10.850
a fresh new world is welcoming him.

05:19.880 --> 05:23.150
=Wuzhu, servant of Fan Xian's late mother=

05:43.640 --> 05:45.860
=Chen Pingping, Head of the Investigator's Office=

05:45.860 --> 05:47.160
Where is Your Lady?

05:48.020 --> 05:51.440
It's too late when I rushed back.

05:56.330 --> 05:59.250
People in the whole city wanted to kill her.

06:08.420 --> 06:10.440
Is it her kid?

06:13.090 --> 06:13.870
Yes.

06:13.890 --> 06:15.320
Is he still alive?

06:15.740 --> 06:16.440
Yes, he is.

06:16.460 --> 06:17.850
Let me take a look.

06:44.540 --> 06:46.640
Where do you want to take him?

06:48.650 --> 06:50.160
A safe place.

06:55.260 --> 06:57.290
Now that I am back,

06:58.460 --> 07:00.810
the capital city is the safest place for him.

07:02.930 --> 07:04.750
When My Lady was killed,

07:04.770 --> 07:06.240
why did you and your black knights

07:06.260 --> 07:08.250
not stay in the capital city?

07:09.210 --> 07:11.010
I did it as what I was told.

07:19.460 --> 07:21.970
You mean there is a hidden force

07:23.740 --> 07:26.040
behind the killing?

07:27.170 --> 07:29.130
Everyone in the city,

07:29.740 --> 07:31.090
I

07:31.770 --> 07:33.320
never trust them.

07:36.330 --> 07:38.250
So, you just take him away like this?

07:39.420 --> 07:41.440
What can you teach him?

07:42.610 --> 07:44.010
Wuzhu.

07:45.580 --> 07:48.290
You are most skilled at martial arts in the world,

07:48.420 --> 07:49.870
but all you know is killing people.

07:49.890 --> 07:51.530
And you are no different.

07:52.610 --> 07:53.970
Stop!

07:55.020 --> 07:57.010
There is a place suitable for him.

07:58.260 --> 07:59.350
Where is it?

07:59.370 --> 08:00.920
Danzhou.

08:01.490 --> 08:02.920
You know that place.

08:03.770 --> 08:05.880
The Madam lives there.

08:18.770 --> 08:20.960
I have the memories about the modern life,

08:20.980 --> 08:22.970
but now I become a kid.

08:23.260 --> 08:24.840
The fate gives me a chance to

08:24.860 --> 08:26.190
get rid of an incurable disease

08:26.210 --> 08:27.720
and live my life once again,

08:27.860 --> 08:29.600
I will never miss it.

08:31.960 --> 08:36.190
The Fan Mansion

08:43.260 --> 08:45.280
About my present name,

08:46.610 --> 08:47.910
I am Fan Xian,

08:47.930 --> 08:49.710
I know what's in your mind.

08:49.730 --> 08:51.370
This name

08:51.610 --> 08:53.400
is really annoying.

08:59.920 --> 09:02.750
=Infant Fan Xian=

09:29.290 --> 09:30.600
You don't know?

09:31.970 --> 09:33.030
Stop it!

09:33.050 --> 09:34.600
Stop it!

09:34.960 --> 09:36.410
=Butler Zhou, butler of the Fan mansion in Danzhou=

09:36.410 --> 09:37.920
My Lady.

09:41.490 --> 09:43.270
You're back finally!

09:43.290 --> 09:45.640
=Boy Fan Xian=
Both of them are servant girls in my yard.

09:45.660 --> 09:47.080
Did you beat them?

09:47.370 --> 09:50.200
Young Master, you like running around,

09:50.220 --> 09:51.390
it's fine.

09:51.410 --> 09:53.600
But you shouldn't

09:54.140 --> 09:57.000
take My Lady with you.

09:57.020 --> 09:58.890
If anything bad happens,

09:59.820 --> 10:00.410
you will

10:00.410 --> 10:02.200
never afford to bear the responsibility.

10:02.220 --> 10:03.320
Do you think so?

10:03.340 --> 10:05.600
I ask whether you beat them or not.

10:08.530 --> 10:09.220
They don't know

10:09.220 --> 10:10.810
where you have gone.

10:11.340 --> 10:13.450
They really don't know that.

10:15.340 --> 10:18.010
So they should be punished.

10:19.170 --> 10:20.720
Am I right?

10:21.700 --> 10:22.930
Well, they are my maids,

10:22.930 --> 10:24.810
should they be under my charge?

10:24.970 --> 10:27.130
Madam asks me to be the butler,

10:27.170 --> 10:29.330
then I think

10:29.490 --> 10:32.210
I still have the right to teach them.

10:35.610 --> 10:36.890
You don't know.

10:38.260 --> 10:39.770
- You don't know. - Stop it.

10:42.100 --> 10:43.030
Young Master.

10:43.050 --> 10:45.370
Then I go on helping you teach them.

10:47.820 --> 10:49.280
Stop it.

10:52.410 --> 10:53.890
Stop it.

10:57.780 --> 10:59.440
You... What are you...

10:59.460 --> 11:00.770
Come over here.

11:02.900 --> 11:04.330
Closer.

11:10.900 --> 11:12.480
Put your head straight.

11:37.100 --> 11:38.720
Do you have any problems with that?

11:41.820 --> 11:45.520
It's right and proper for you to beat me.

11:48.820 --> 11:50.210
Serve the meal.

11:52.170 --> 11:53.520
Serve the meal.

11:58.640 --> 11:59.530
=Madam Fan, Nanqing Earl Sinan Fan Jian's mother=

11:59.530 --> 12:01.210
Who did it?

12:03.290 --> 12:04.650
Madam.

12:05.260 --> 12:07.890
It's the Young Master.

12:08.410 --> 12:09.800
You beat him?

12:09.820 --> 12:12.400
Grandma, have you eaten?

12:12.850 --> 12:14.480
I am asking you.

12:14.660 --> 12:16.250
I did it.

12:18.140 --> 12:19.730
Butler Zhou beat the servant girls
=Fan Ruoruo, Nanqing Earl Sinan Fan Jian's daughter=

12:19.730 --> 12:20.820
in brother's yard first!

12:20.820 --> 12:22.250
Alright.

12:32.850 --> 12:34.390
Butler Zhou.

12:34.410 --> 12:35.650
Madam.

12:36.370 --> 12:38.450
Change those servant girls

12:38.780 --> 12:40.450
in his yard.

12:40.580 --> 12:41.560
I will.

12:41.580 --> 12:42.610
I am going to find some sensible girls

12:42.610 --> 12:44.480
for Young Master now.

12:45.290 --> 12:46.470
No need, grandma.

12:46.490 --> 12:47.350
I like it quiet in my yard.

12:47.370 --> 12:48.140
From today on,

12:48.140 --> 12:49.920
I don't need any servants any more.

12:50.140 --> 12:51.920
Then remove all of them.

12:53.530 --> 12:56.370
Okay, I'll do it right now.

13:01.100 --> 13:02.960
The carriage is at the gate.

13:03.290 --> 13:04.760
After the meal,

13:04.780 --> 13:07.040
Ruoruo will set out and go back to the capital city.

13:13.340 --> 13:14.440
How about my brother?

13:14.460 --> 13:16.080
He will stay in Danzhou.

13:31.820 --> 13:33.040
Go ahead.

13:55.610 --> 13:57.120
Young Master Fan Xian,

13:57.140 --> 13:59.480
please don't be too sad.

13:59.530 --> 14:02.200
Lady Ruoruo is born from a noble family,

14:02.220 --> 14:04.570
she will go back to the capital city sooner or later.

14:04.820 --> 14:07.890
Your name is not even in the family pedigree.
You are nobody in the family.

14:08.140 --> 14:11.590
Lady Ruoruo is very different from you.

14:11.610 --> 14:12.760
Well.

14:12.780 --> 14:14.150
I have removed all the servant girls

14:14.170 --> 14:15.600
in your yard.

14:15.820 --> 14:17.440
In such a big yard,

14:17.460 --> 14:19.690
when you are alone at night,

14:20.020 --> 14:22.120
you should be careful

14:22.140 --> 14:24.390
in case you see a ghost.

14:24.410 --> 14:26.480
Did you lose your fore tooth?

14:30.730 --> 14:32.030
Back tooth.

14:32.050 --> 14:33.470
Then why do they leak air when you are speaking?

14:33.490 --> 14:34.590
Leak air?

14:34.610 --> 14:36.370
Just like

14:36.610 --> 14:37.690
farting.

15:24.340 --> 15:25.960
Are you Fan Xian?

15:26.260 --> 15:28.280
There you are!

15:32.020 --> 15:33.320
Who am I?

15:33.340 --> 15:34.890
You are my dad!

15:34.970 --> 15:36.280
I...

15:37.580 --> 15:38.580
I am not your dad.

15:38.580 --> 15:40.470
You are my dad for sure!

15:40.490 --> 15:42.080
She prepared it for you.

15:49.660 --> 15:51.210
What is it?

15:51.410 --> 15:52.840
Bamboo leaf tea.

16:06.850 --> 16:08.840
Who prepared it for me?

16:09.170 --> 16:10.400
My mom.

16:10.460 --> 16:12.450
Bullshit!

16:12.730 --> 16:15.010
Your mom died on the day when you were born.

16:15.100 --> 16:16.560
She did not.

16:16.580 --> 16:17.840
The where is she?

16:18.610 --> 16:19.890
She is over there.

16:39.900 --> 16:41.400
Dead.

16:49.900 --> 16:50.910
The shop is closed.

16:50.930 --> 16:53.150
You should come tomorrow
if you want to buy something.

16:53.170 --> 16:55.100
Somebody wants to kill me.

16:55.120 --> 16:56.640
=Wuzhu, servant of Fan Xian's late mother=
Do you want me to report to the government?

16:56.640 --> 16:58.320
You should take care of me, shouldn't you?

16:58.340 --> 16:59.810
Uncle Wuzhu.

16:59.970 --> 17:02.010
Uncle Wuzhu. Open the door.

17:10.220 --> 17:12.290
I killed a man.

17:22.290 --> 17:23.600
He is not dead.

17:25.050 --> 17:26.410
He is going to wake up.

17:30.580 --> 17:31.870
His name is Fei Jie.

17:31.890 --> 17:33.360
He is the Director of the Third Division

17:33.380 --> 17:35.270
of the Investigator's Office in the capital city.

17:35.290 --> 17:36.890
He is one of us.

17:37.650 --> 17:38.580
Well, when I was knocking him,

17:38.580 --> 17:40.170
why didn't you tell me?

17:40.770 --> 17:42.200
You didn't ask me.

17:43.170 --> 17:44.560
Well, what to do now?

17:44.580 --> 17:46.680
I have knocked him for three times.

17:46.700 --> 17:48.290
Will he remember it and bear the grudges?

17:48.380 --> 17:49.010
He is one of us?

17:49.010 --> 17:51.200
Why does he have such a wretched appearance?

18:00.000 --> 18:02.390
=Fei Jie, director of the Third Division of the Investigator's Office=

18:04.930 --> 18:06.320
You wake up?

18:14.010 --> 18:15.600
What happened to me just now?

18:16.220 --> 18:18.770
You fell asleep while sitting up.

18:37.460 --> 18:39.770
Actually you were knocked out by someone.

18:40.930 --> 18:42.030
Is that you?

18:42.050 --> 18:43.680
No, it's not.

18:43.820 --> 18:45.650
Then, who did it if it was not you?!

18:54.740 --> 18:56.250
He knocked you out.

18:58.860 --> 19:00.290
Wuzhu.

19:00.980 --> 19:02.370
Wuzhu.

19:02.820 --> 19:03.700
It's been a long time since we
parted in the capital city last time.

19:03.700 --> 19:06.010
You look the same as ever.

19:07.130 --> 19:10.320
I have been always missing you.

19:10.340 --> 19:12.680
Why are you here?

19:12.700 --> 19:14.510
His Excellency Fan and the Head

19:14.530 --> 19:16.510
asked me to be Fan Xian's master.

19:16.530 --> 19:18.720
My father asked you to be here?

19:19.010 --> 19:21.370
His Excellency Fan has no time to come here.

19:21.580 --> 19:23.800
But he is always missing you.

19:25.010 --> 19:26.170
It's my fault and

19:26.170 --> 19:27.630
I shouldn't sneak around.

19:27.650 --> 19:29.910
No wonder you knocked me out.

19:29.930 --> 19:31.290
It's not me.

19:32.860 --> 19:34.130
It's him!

19:38.460 --> 19:39.840
Not one.

19:40.290 --> 19:41.770
But three times.

19:46.520 --> 19:47.820
For mother only

19:47.820 --> 19:49.250
Madam.

19:49.290 --> 19:50.620
This is a letter

19:50.620 --> 19:52.800
from His Excellency Fan.

20:00.100 --> 20:02.440
What happened to your head?

20:03.820 --> 20:08.080
I was attacked by someone on my way here.

20:08.620 --> 20:11.200
Has the criminal been arrested?

20:11.220 --> 20:13.410
Sorry to annoy you.

20:14.980 --> 20:17.010
He has been arrested.

20:17.860 --> 20:19.480
That's good.

20:20.620 --> 20:22.680
You told me that

20:22.740 --> 20:25.220
my son asked you to be here

20:25.220 --> 20:27.510
from far away to

20:27.530 --> 20:30.220
teach Fan Xian?

20:30.220 --> 20:31.600
That's right.

20:32.530 --> 20:36.200
What will you teach him?

20:36.500 --> 20:40.320
Actually I know something
about civil and military skills.

20:40.860 --> 20:42.320
Could you please tell me

20:42.340 --> 20:44.960
what I could teach him?

20:45.100 --> 20:47.750
You may do what you think is suitable.

20:47.770 --> 20:50.320
What he could learn

20:51.460 --> 20:53.560
depends on himself.

21:05.860 --> 21:07.030
Where is the kitchen?

21:07.050 --> 21:08.600
It's not the meal time.

21:08.620 --> 21:10.440
Well, I... I am hungry.

21:10.460 --> 21:12.620
Tell me where the kitchen is.

21:12.620 --> 21:13.990
I want something to eat.

21:14.010 --> 21:15.650
There is no food.

21:16.170 --> 21:16.770
You just tell me

21:16.770 --> 21:18.410
where the kitchen is.

21:18.820 --> 21:20.600
It's over there.

21:21.100 --> 21:22.650
Mr. Fei.

21:23.340 --> 21:24.440
May I talk to you for a minute?

21:24.460 --> 21:25.930
Okay.

21:33.460 --> 21:34.800
Mr. Fei.

21:35.700 --> 21:38.600
What will you teach him?

21:40.250 --> 21:42.480
Please give me some advices.

21:43.170 --> 21:45.010
You must have heard

21:45.050 --> 21:46.290
what the Madam has said

21:46.290 --> 21:46.890
Yeah.

21:46.890 --> 21:49.700
What you should teach and shouldn't,

21:49.700 --> 21:53.150
you must figure it out in your mind.

21:53.170 --> 21:55.700
How about teaching him to read

21:55.700 --> 21:57.410
but nothing else?

21:57.930 --> 21:59.440
That's too mean.

21:59.460 --> 22:01.030
Then I can teach him to practice medicine.

22:01.050 --> 22:02.800
Practice medicine?

22:03.890 --> 22:05.980
If he is driven out of the family,

22:05.980 --> 22:07.010
he could be a doctor to

22:07.010 --> 22:08.800
raise money and feed himself.

22:08.820 --> 22:11.200
It's up to you.

22:14.620 --> 22:16.320
Your father has married another woman

22:16.340 --> 22:18.410
in the capital city.

22:19.290 --> 22:21.110
And they have a son now.

22:21.130 --> 22:22.680
I know it.

22:24.130 --> 22:26.560
He even doesn't salute when seeing me.

22:27.980 --> 22:29.980
You thought I can't see it,

22:29.980 --> 22:32.170
and then you can fool me?

22:32.250 --> 22:33.410
I'm telling you. No way.

22:33.410 --> 22:36.800
How about killing him?

22:37.820 --> 22:40.110
I will make it natural.

22:40.130 --> 22:42.290
That guy is hateful,

22:42.340 --> 22:44.560
but we can't go so far as to kill him.

22:45.290 --> 22:46.410
Right.

22:47.050 --> 22:49.650
Let me know if you change your mind.

22:50.930 --> 22:52.200
I'm telling you.

22:55.220 --> 22:56.600
After having the porridge,

22:56.620 --> 22:58.560
I will go back to the bedroom
and have a good rest.

22:59.700 --> 23:01.680
You really knocked hard on my head.

23:02.930 --> 23:05.680
When I wake up, I will teach you.

23:05.700 --> 23:07.390
What will you teach me?

23:07.410 --> 23:08.800
Medicine.

23:08.980 --> 23:10.770
Medicine?

23:10.860 --> 23:12.890
These are some unmarked graves.

23:13.740 --> 23:15.410
I could tell.

23:17.500 --> 23:19.770
Just pick one.

23:29.170 --> 23:30.560
Dig it out.

23:48.580 --> 23:49.890
It's done.

23:49.980 --> 23:50.720
Open it.

23:50.740 --> 23:52.010
Alright.

23:54.380 --> 23:56.200
Why don't you ask me the reason?

23:56.220 --> 23:57.680
For what?

23:58.290 --> 23:59.910
Why do I ask you to open the coffin?

23:59.930 --> 24:01.510
I should know human's body first.

24:01.530 --> 24:02.960
And then get a dead body to dissect.

24:02.980 --> 24:04.390
This is the first step for my study.

24:04.410 --> 24:05.960
That's normal.

24:08.010 --> 24:09.320
Open it.

24:16.980 --> 24:18.510
It's still fresh.

24:18.530 --> 24:19.560
Cut it open.

24:19.580 --> 24:20.960
Check out the cause of death.

24:20.980 --> 24:22.200
Cut it.

24:28.130 --> 24:29.960
Are you afraid?

24:29.980 --> 24:31.270
There are too many bacteria here.

24:31.290 --> 24:33.080
I should get protected.

24:33.100 --> 24:34.530
What is bacteria?

24:35.460 --> 24:36.510
I mean it's dirty.

24:36.530 --> 24:38.530
I'd better put on a pair of gloves at least.

24:39.740 --> 24:41.100
When you cut a body open,

24:41.100 --> 24:43.720
you should use your hands to get every detail.

24:43.740 --> 24:45.480
It's not convenient to dissect a body

24:46.740 --> 24:49.770
when you wear a pair of gloves.

24:50.220 --> 24:52.510
It's not what you wear in winter.

24:52.530 --> 24:55.010
The gloves for operation are very thin.

24:55.220 --> 24:57.720
They are close fitting, do you know that?

24:57.980 --> 24:58.980
About the gloves you just mentioned,

24:58.980 --> 25:00.960
I have never heard about it before.

25:01.290 --> 25:02.650
After the dissection,

25:02.650 --> 25:04.930
you can wash your hands.

25:13.100 --> 25:14.910
Uncle Wuzhu is awesome.

25:14.930 --> 25:18.250
He even could compete with the Four Great Masters.

25:21.100 --> 25:22.220
If it were not for Wuzhu's low profile,

25:22.220 --> 25:25.080
he would be famous

25:25.100 --> 25:26.680
and become the fifth great master

25:26.700 --> 25:29.130
in the world.

25:29.740 --> 25:32.320
What's the relationship between
my mom and Uncle Wuzhu?

25:32.620 --> 25:36.080
He was your mother's servant.

25:36.650 --> 25:38.890
Well, my mom must be more awesome!

25:38.980 --> 25:42.170
Your mother actually was unparalleled in the world.

25:42.250 --> 25:44.130
How did she die that year?

25:44.340 --> 25:45.390
I can't tell you.

25:45.410 --> 25:47.080
Just tell me a little.

25:47.100 --> 25:48.910
You talk too much.

25:48.930 --> 25:50.840
You can't bear it, can you?

26:02.740 --> 26:03.680
You...

26:03.700 --> 26:06.290
There is something that you can't bear?

26:07.860 --> 26:11.480
Teacher, I am still a kid.

26:17.250 --> 26:18.680
Uncle.

26:18.890 --> 26:21.800
I have dissected the body for a whole night.

26:22.380 --> 26:24.560
And you just cook this for me?

26:24.580 --> 26:25.800
Yeah.

26:26.650 --> 26:28.200
Will you put some ingredients into it?

26:28.460 --> 26:29.890
No.

26:30.980 --> 26:33.410
Did my mom teach you how to cook it?

26:38.530 --> 26:40.170
What do you want to say?

26:40.410 --> 26:42.770
What kind of person my mom is?

26:43.290 --> 26:44.990
Her name is Ye Qingmei.

26:45.010 --> 26:46.320
What else?

26:54.340 --> 26:55.960
The others...

26:55.980 --> 26:57.370
I've forgotten all of them.

27:03.380 --> 27:04.960
You gave me

27:04.980 --> 27:06.050
this secret skills about vitality Qi.

27:06.050 --> 27:07.530
Do you remember it?

27:08.250 --> 27:10.320
It's your mother who gave it to you.

27:11.380 --> 27:12.170
I have practiced it

27:12.170 --> 27:14.080
and I got some problems.

27:14.100 --> 27:16.680
I can't control it. It's really overbearing.

27:16.770 --> 27:18.010
Uncle.

27:18.820 --> 27:20.510
Does it have a name?

27:20.530 --> 27:21.560
Yes.

27:21.580 --> 27:22.800
What is it?

27:22.860 --> 27:24.480
“Overbearing Vitality Qi”.

27:25.170 --> 27:25.930
It seems like

27:25.930 --> 27:28.130
you name it just now?

27:29.650 --> 27:32.080
If I can't control it well,

27:32.100 --> 27:34.200
I'm afraid it will do harm to my body.

27:34.770 --> 27:35.750
Uncle.

27:35.770 --> 27:38.130
How can I practice it?

27:50.130 --> 27:51.440
I have no idea.

27:51.770 --> 27:53.840
I haven't practiced it.

27:54.770 --> 27:57.840
But my teacher told me you are super awesome.

27:59.220 --> 28:00.530
Not bad.

28:01.620 --> 28:03.800
Did my mother die of anger because of you?

28:04.170 --> 28:05.680
I've forgotten it.

28:05.860 --> 28:07.220
Well, about my problem,

28:07.220 --> 28:09.200
what on earth should I do?

28:10.650 --> 28:14.560
Finish the radish and follow me.

28:20.620 --> 28:22.200
To where?

28:24.820 --> 28:26.230
Use the Qi

28:26.250 --> 28:28.200
and fill it to your feet.

28:28.220 --> 28:30.010
The speed will be faster.

28:54.250 --> 28:55.910
I haven't practiced Kungfu

28:55.930 --> 28:57.840
and don't know how to use the Qi.

28:58.100 --> 29:00.390
So I find out a way

29:00.410 --> 29:01.960
to practice your skills.

29:01.980 --> 29:03.230
What is it?

29:03.250 --> 29:04.530
I will beat you.

29:05.170 --> 29:06.200
And then?

29:06.220 --> 29:07.230
You dodge.

29:07.250 --> 29:09.560
And this is your way?

29:09.770 --> 29:11.750
If only you have a good judgement,

29:11.770 --> 29:13.800
response, speed

29:13.820 --> 29:15.250
and power,

29:18.050 --> 29:19.840
try to dodge.

29:33.980 --> 29:35.200
Once again.

30:07.980 --> 30:09.530
It's okay.

30:10.130 --> 30:12.200
Kids like sleeping.

30:27.650 --> 30:31.600
Think about it. What poison is it?

30:32.290 --> 30:34.440
When were you poisoned?

30:34.620 --> 30:36.770
And how?

30:38.980 --> 30:41.870
When I was picking up the chopsticks,

30:41.890 --> 30:43.560
you poisoned me.

30:44.980 --> 30:46.650
It tastes astringent,

30:46.890 --> 30:50.290
so you mixed it in the edible wild herbs.

30:55.410 --> 30:59.480
You can choose one as I teach you.

31:12.410 --> 31:13.890
No.

31:24.050 --> 31:25.370
What about...

31:25.500 --> 31:27.270
Take it if you make your decision.

31:27.290 --> 31:28.320
...this one?

31:28.340 --> 31:30.170
You will know after taking it.

31:50.580 --> 31:51.840
What's wrong?

31:55.100 --> 31:57.010
Teacher, what happened to me?

31:58.250 --> 32:00.080
Your choice is wrong.

32:01.130 --> 32:02.410
But the smell in the other bottles

32:02.410 --> 32:04.130
is not right.

32:04.650 --> 32:06.910
I told you to choose one bottle,

32:06.930 --> 32:08.200
but I didn't say

32:08.220 --> 32:09.500
the cure was among them.

32:09.500 --> 32:11.030
Teacher, you are too...

32:11.050 --> 32:12.680
Teacher.

32:13.340 --> 32:14.530
You went too far.

32:14.530 --> 32:15.530
Why didn't you say you went too far

32:15.530 --> 32:17.440
when you knocked me out?

32:17.740 --> 32:18.870
If you have any problems with that,

32:18.890 --> 32:20.270
you can poison me.

32:20.290 --> 32:21.800
If you can make it,

32:21.820 --> 32:23.680
then we can finish the apprenticeship.

32:38.820 --> 32:41.480
It's my turn to teach him today.

32:42.890 --> 32:45.050
Let me teach him today.

33:16.170 --> 33:17.150
Uncle.

33:17.170 --> 33:19.510
I think I can't make it forever.

33:19.530 --> 33:21.410
You just need time.

33:23.250 --> 33:24.680
My teacher said

33:24.700 --> 33:26.750
you were on the same level
with the Four Great Masters.

33:26.770 --> 33:27.680
Kind of.

33:27.700 --> 33:28.380
Have you fought with them?

33:28.380 --> 33:29.560
Not all of them.

33:29.580 --> 33:31.050
Who won?

33:31.170 --> 33:32.510
I made it even.

33:32.530 --> 33:35.200
They are the most powerful four men in the world.

33:35.220 --> 33:36.560
You have never learned Kungfu,

33:36.580 --> 33:39.080
how can you make it even with them?

33:39.100 --> 33:41.340
If only you are fast

33:41.340 --> 33:42.200
and strong enough.

33:42.220 --> 33:44.770
How powerful should you be to
match with those great masters?

33:48.220 --> 33:49.480
Uncle Wuzhu.

33:57.930 --> 34:00.620
Uncle, in the front is a cliff.

34:00.620 --> 34:01.910
If you could be so powerful as me,

34:01.930 --> 34:03.370
then you can make it.

34:13.340 --> 34:14.690
Uncle.

34:26.690 --> 34:29.560
Is he a real human?

34:33.180 --> 34:34.840
Teacher, please have a seat.

34:35.210 --> 34:36.920
This is the poisoned tea I just made.

34:36.940 --> 34:38.210
Please have a taste.

35:00.180 --> 35:01.920
Tharm-cutting flower again?

35:01.940 --> 35:03.660
But I didn't put it in the tea.

35:03.660 --> 35:05.450
How did you make it?

35:05.660 --> 35:09.690
The inner part is toxic but the skin is not.

35:10.050 --> 35:13.000
Just think about it.

35:30.140 --> 35:31.890
Gotcha!

35:32.100 --> 35:33.490
What poison is it?

35:33.820 --> 35:36.600
It's not the poison but time.

35:36.620 --> 35:37.950
These days,

35:37.970 --> 35:41.320
you had a lot of good tonics.

35:41.730 --> 35:44.030
Teacher, you are not poisoned.

35:44.050 --> 35:45.840
You just had too many tonics and

35:45.860 --> 35:47.490
you have too prosperous qi and blood.

35:48.380 --> 35:50.730
You are so smart.

35:50.770 --> 35:53.970
That's a unique way.

35:54.900 --> 35:56.560
Now my apprenticeship is finished?

35:57.380 --> 35:59.430
I can finish the apprenticeship
if I poison you successfully?

35:59.450 --> 36:00.730
Yes.

36:03.290 --> 36:05.650
I made it!

36:24.690 --> 36:28.000
All good things come to an end. I should go now.

36:28.530 --> 36:29.840
Stop here.

36:31.820 --> 36:33.130
These years,

36:33.730 --> 36:36.170
the only person who I can completely trust

36:36.450 --> 36:38.320
is Uncle Wuzhu.

36:39.100 --> 36:40.970
He totally deserves it.

36:42.820 --> 36:44.600
But now I have another people who I can trust.

36:50.450 --> 36:51.770
Don't forget you have such a naughty student

36:51.770 --> 36:53.730
like me in Danzhou.

36:57.250 --> 36:58.490
Here you are.

37:01.900 --> 37:04.130
It's the token of Director-General
of the investigator's office.

37:04.180 --> 37:06.280
The Head asked me to give it to you.

37:06.660 --> 37:09.690
Did he know me?

37:10.210 --> 37:13.040
He knows your mother.

37:14.010 --> 37:15.560
And I have something for you.

37:28.530 --> 37:30.120
It's made of lamb intestine.

37:30.140 --> 37:32.160
You can put it on

37:32.180 --> 37:33.690
when you dissect bodies or test the poisons.

37:33.770 --> 37:34.970
I will.

37:37.100 --> 37:38.410
I like it.

37:41.210 --> 37:43.800
If I met you earlier,

37:44.900 --> 37:47.560
I may choose another way.

37:48.010 --> 37:49.800
Maybe I would marry a woman

37:51.050 --> 37:51.970
and have a naughty boy

37:51.970 --> 37:53.890
like you.

37:55.210 --> 37:56.520
Teacher.

37:57.530 --> 37:59.800
I will take care of you when you are old
and give proper burial after your death.

38:21.490 --> 38:25.040
He left and it turns out to be a good thing.

38:25.180 --> 38:27.130
If he stays here,

38:27.340 --> 38:29.380
he will attract people's attention

38:29.380 --> 38:31.450
from the capital city.

38:32.420 --> 38:34.130
Am I in danger?

38:36.580 --> 38:39.880
If the red-armor knights

38:39.900 --> 38:42.690
appear in the street here,

38:43.660 --> 38:49.600
the real danger will come.

38:50.860 --> 38:53.170
Who are the red-armor knights?

39:01.340 --> 39:03.320
Young Master Fan Xian, what are you doing?

39:03.340 --> 39:04.970
I am waiting for the red-armor knights.

39:04.970 --> 39:06.840
Who are they?

39:06.860 --> 39:08.280
You don't understand.

40:00.840 --> 40:03.390
=Fan Xian, bastard son of Nanqing Earl Sinan Fan Jian=

40:07.340 --> 40:08.230
Young Master Fan Xian.

40:08.250 --> 40:10.040
Are you still waiting for the red-armor knights?

41:29.530 --> 41:31.760
These people are here to escort me to the capital city?

41:32.340 --> 41:33.890
Who asked them here?

41:34.210 --> 41:36.280
Your father, of course.

41:36.820 --> 41:38.600
I have refused him.

41:39.530 --> 41:41.930
The capital city is not a good place.

41:42.660 --> 41:44.560
Your mother died there.

41:46.010 --> 41:49.970
You can live longer if you stay here.

41:49.970 --> 41:52.280
But they are kneeling out of the door.

41:52.900 --> 41:54.450
Leave them alone.

41:55.490 --> 41:59.730
If they kneel there till they die, just bury them.

42:24.760 --> 42:28.340
In the river of history,

42:28.360 --> 42:31.830
time goes round and round.

42:34.640 --> 42:37.980
Memories about the former and present lives

42:38.000 --> 42:42.070
join each other in an endless way.

42:43.950 --> 42:46.600
In the long drunken Milky Way,

42:46.620 --> 42:48.840
one season follows another in a flash,

42:48.840 --> 42:51.340
and the wild geese are flying south.

42:51.360 --> 42:52.960
I just can't give up

42:52.960 --> 42:56.300
to be with you for my whole life.

42:56.320 --> 43:01.790
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:03.040 --> 43:05.590
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:05.880 --> 43:07.920
Year after year in the wandering,

43:07.920 --> 43:10.580
I count the remaining years.

43:10.600 --> 43:12.780
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:12.800 --> 43:14.790
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:15.080 --> 43:17.470
I never feel regretful.

43:17.520 --> 43:18.880
In such a chaotic world,

43:18.880 --> 43:21.860
I still miss you as ever.

43:21.880 --> 43:24.830
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

43:25.120 --> 43:27.180
With a gentle heart,

43:27.200 --> 43:29.860
I cherish our remaining years.

43:29.880 --> 43:31.400
Even though we have to go through

43:31.400 --> 43:33.910
all the hardships along the journey,

43:34.040 --> 43:41.230
you always stay by my side,

43:41.320 --> 43:43.990
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

43:44.280 --> 43:46.360
Year after year in the wandering,

43:46.360 --> 43:49.020
I count the remaining years.

43:49.040 --> 43:51.180
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:51.200 --> 43:53.430
even though we end up the destiny,

43:53.640 --> 43:55.820
I never feel regretful.

43:55.840 --> 43:57.240
In such a chaotic world,

43:57.240 --> 44:00.300
I still miss you as ever.

44:00.320 --> 44:03.430
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:03.520 --> 44:05.660
With a gentle heart,

44:05.680 --> 44:08.380
I cherish our remaining years.

44:08.400 --> 44:09.840
Even though we have to go through

44:09.840 --> 44:12.500
all the hardships along the journey,

44:12.520 --> 44:21.280
you always stay by my side...
